to Prospect Park and Manhattan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/01/realestate/prospect-lefferts-gardens-brooklyn-diverse-historic-and-convenient.html', 'snippet': 'The neighborhood offers a mix of people and architectural styles, as well as easy access to Prospect Park and Manhattan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the summer of 2015, Matthew Blinstrubas and Milap Patel celebrated their wedding at the LeFrak Center at Lakeside in Prospect Park, Brooklyn, with no idea that they would soon own an apartment two blocks away. For a year and a half they had been living together in a rented studio in Prospect Heights, dreaming of a two-bedroom where they could welcome family and friends.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/realestate/05LIVING-PROSPECT-LEFFERT-slide-YG55/05LIVING-PROSPECT-LEFFERT-slide-YG55-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/05/realestate/05LIVING-PROSPECT-LEFFERT-slide-YG55/05LIVING-PROSPECT-LEFFERT-slide-YG55-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/realestate/05LIVING-PROSPECT-LEFFERT-slide-YG55/05LIVING-PROSPECT-LEFFERT-slide-YG55-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/realestate/05LIVING-PROSPECT-LEFFERT-slide-YG55/05LIVING-PROSPECT-LEFFERT-slide-YG55-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/realestate/05LIVI