e, along with the dress and confines of her gender.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2017/02/01/t-magazine/art/a-groundbreaking-20th-century-artist-rediscovered.html', 'snippet': 'As a young woman, Gluck (born Hannah Gluckstein) rejected her family name, along with the dress and confines of her gender.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a young woman, Gluck (born Hannah Gluckstein) rejected her family name, along with the dress and confines of her gender.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/01/t-magazine/art/01tmag-gluck-slide-5FUX/01tmag-gluck-slide-5FUX-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/01/t-magazine/art/01tmag-gluck-slide-5FUX/01tmag-gluck-slide-5FUX-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/01/t-magazine/art/01tmag-gluck-slide-5FUX/01tmag-gluck-slide-5FUX-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/01/t-magazine/art/01tmag-gluck-slide-5FUX/01tmag-gluck-slide-5FUX-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 822, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/01/t-magazine/art/01tmag-gluck-slide-5FUX/01tmag-gluck-slide-5FUX-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 822}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/01/t-magazine/art/01tmag-gluck-slide-5FUX/01tmag-gluck-slide-5FUX-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 748, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'captio