ce-film-festival-what-9-actors-and-filmmakers-wore.html', 'snippet': 'The annual film festival brought together 120 feature-length films. Here is what indie-film insiders wore on the white carpet. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'This year’s Sundance Film Festival, which ended on Sunday, brought together 120 feature-length films and 40 first-time filmmakers to Park City, Utah. Last Friday, as distributors shopped, producers hawked and a comedy called “Fun Mom Dinner” had its premiere, these six indie-film insiders showed us how they dressed for the white carpet.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/02/fashion/02LAAR2-COMBO/02LAAR2-COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/02/fashion/02LAAR2-COMBO/02LAAR2-COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/02/fashion/02LAAR2-COMBO/02LAAR2-COMBO-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/02/fashion/02LAAR2-COMBO/02LAAR2-COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/02/fashion/02LAAR2-COMBO/02LAAR2-COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/02/fashion/02LAAR2-COMBO/02LAAR2-COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/02