icle/9861ce3d-59d4-573f-b566-ab5160351e89'}, {'abstract': 'We talk with three women with interesting journeys to the United States about their perspective on President Trump’s immigration ban.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/02/podcasts/three-paths-to-america.html', 'snippet': 'We talk with three women with interesting journeys to the United States about their perspective on President Trump’s immigration ban.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We spent all weekend trying to understand the immigration ban signed into effect by President Trump last week aimed at keeping refugees and residents of seven majority-Muslim countries from entering the United States, and realized there isn’t enough bandwidth in the world to process the scale and scope of this decision.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/02/arts/02processing/02processing-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/02/arts/02processing/02processing-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/02/arts/02processing/02processing-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/02/arts/02processing/02processing-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/02/arts/02processing/02processing-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/02/arts/02processing/02processing-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'w