arketing tool, a sponsor’s flagship, a cultural event and, of course, a live performance with no second chances, to be applauded or ruthlessly dissected, virtually in real time, via every internet resource.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/03/arts/3HALFTIME1/3HALFTIME1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/03/arts/3HALFTIME1/3HALFTIME1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/03/arts/3HALFTIME1/3HALFTIME1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/03/arts/3HALFTIME1/3HALFTIME1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 783, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/03/arts/3HALFTIME1/3HALFTIME1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 783}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/03/arts/3HALFTIME1/3HALFTIME1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 785, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/03/arts/3HALFTIME1/3HALFTIME1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1137, 'width': 871, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Women Rule Halftime. Can Lady Gaga Make It Rock Again?', 'kicker': "Critic's Notebook", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Women Lead at the Half', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}