'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/02/movies/review-the-space-between-us-the-story-of-a-boy-who-fell-to-earth.html', 'snippet': 'Peter Chelsom’s movie concerns a young human (Asa Butterfield), raised in isolation on Mars, who visits Earth and a video-chat pal (Britt Robertson).', 'lead_paragraph': 'With the disappearance of video stores, there is something heartening about the existence of “The Space Between Us,” a cheesy hunk of science fiction from Peter Chelsom that once would have drawn curious young eyes to VHS shelves. Set in the near future, it plays like a transmission from 1986, when a boy and a spaceship’s robot pilot could raise hell in “Flight of the Navigator,” and Steven Spielberg set the blockbuster template to emulate.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/03/arts/03SPACEAREUS/03SPACEAREUS-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 250, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/03/arts/03SPACEAREUS/03SPACEAREUS-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 250}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/03/arts/03SPACEAREUS/03SPACEAREUS-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/03/arts/03SPACEAREUS/03SPACEAREUS-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 853, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/03/arts/03SPACEAREUS/03SPACEAREUS-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'image