: 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/abe997d6-07d6-56c0-ab1c-1bf7d149ee7b', 'word_count': 1508, 'uri': 'nyt://article/abe997d6-07d6-56c0-ab1c-1bf7d149ee7b'}, {'abstract': 'Trump’s pick to run the Education Department would trash the public school system in which my son flourished.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/03/opinion/why-i-wont-vote-for-betsy-devos.html', 'snippet': 'Trump’s pick to run the Education Department would trash the public school system in which my son flourished.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Our nation recognized early in its history that public education is a necessary foundation for a democracy. It’s critical that we continue to support a strong public education system that prepares our young people, all of them, to participate in our democracy and compete on a fair footing in the work force.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/03/opinion/04hassanWeb/03hassanSub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/03/opinion/04hassanWeb/03hassanSub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/03/opinion/04hassanWeb/03hassanSub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/03/opinion/04hassanWeb/03hassanSub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/03/opinion/04hassanWeb/03hassanSub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subTy