, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hamilton, Alexander', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-04T19:30:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Douthat', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Douthat', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/07814358-eb04-58b3-a10e-bccb25feafac', 'word_count': 812, 'uri': 'nyt://article/07814358-eb04-58b3-a10e-bccb25feafac'}, {'abstract': 'I dispute none of the warnings. But I would like to note that it tastes really, really good.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/04/opinion/sunday/the-case-for-sugar.html', 'snippet': 'I dispute none of the warnings. But I would like to note that it tastes really, really good.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is a hideous injustice overwhelming the world right now. I’m speaking, of course, of the war on sugar. Many books and studies are asserting that sugar causes or contributes to multiple fatal illnesses, costing billions of dollars in health care each year. I dispute none of this. But I would like to add that sugar tastes really, really good.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/opinion/sunday/05rudnick/05rudnick-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 700, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/05/opinion/sunday/05rudnick/05rudnick-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 700}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/opinion/sunday/05rudnick/05rudnick-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 878, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/opinion/sunday/05rudnick/05rudnick-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1755, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/opinion/sunday/05rudnick/05rudnick-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/05/opinion/sunday/05rudnick/05rudnick-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/opinion/sunday/05rudnick/05rudnick-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Case for Sugar', 'kicker': 'Opinion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Case for Sugar', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sugar', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comedy and Humor', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-04T19:30:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Rudnick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rudnick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/9b606458-ada9-501d-b681-09041b9b1244', 'word_count': 644, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9b606458-ada9-501d-b681-09041b9b1244'}, {'abstract': 'I gained 40 pounds with one Betty’s fudge cake while trying to digest the other Betty’s “Feminine Mystique.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/04/opinion/sunday/the-womens-march-in-my-living-room.html', 'snippet': 'I gained 40 pounds with one Betty’s fudge cake while trying to digest the other Betty’s “Feminine Mystique.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'I pull the covers over my head so I can enjoy a few more happy, sleepy minutes of denial before I get up. To bask in how I might have contributed to the universe yesterday, embolden myself for what today brings. I scroll down my inner list, starting with the easy ones, the things I surely accomplished:', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/opinion/sunday/05guiswite/05guiswite-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 229, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/05/opinion/sunday/05guiswite/05guiswite-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 229}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/opinion/sunday/05guiswite/05guiswite-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/opinion/sunday/05guiswite/05guiswite-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 764, 'width': 1999, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/opinion/sunday/05guiswite/05guiswite-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail