his was going to be a war on Islam. Not “radical Islam,” but Islam itself — which includes three million American Muslims and a global population of nearly 1.7 billion people.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/sunday-review/05ali/05ali-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/05/sunday-review/05ali/05ali-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/sunday-review/05ali/05ali-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/sunday-review/05ali/05ali-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/sunday-review/05ali/05ali-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/05/sunday-review/05ali/05ali-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/sunday-review/05ali/05ali-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'My Resistance Movement', 'kicker': 'Contributing Op-Ed Writer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'We Were  All Warned', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslim Americans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-04T19:30:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Wajahat Ali', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Wajahat', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ali', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa32e2cc-13f1-5c75-9e60-1299cf07e973', 'word_count': 780, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa32e2cc-13f1-5c75-9e60-1299cf07e973'}, {'abstract': 'The West is on its way to recording an aggregate edge over the East for a ninth straight season, just one reflection of its continued superiority.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/04/sports/nba-west-golden-state-warriors-best.html', 'snippet': 'The West is on its way to recording an aggregate edge over the East for a ninth straight season, just one reflection of its continued superiority.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LeBron James and the Cleveland Cavaliers played at Madison Square Garden on Saturday night, fulfilling their manifest destiny as basketball villains and bullies against the Knicks. But as this N.B.A. regular season barrels toward the playoffs, perhaps the locals should be more supportive. The Cavaliers, after all, still represent the Eastern Conference’s best and last line of defense against the stubbornly superior, haughty West.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/05/sports/05score2/05score2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/05/sports/05score2/05score2-thumbS