://slideshow/bf036da2-0960-520e-837c-12861bd0637f'}, {'abstract': 'Prominent Democrats, including John Kerry and Madeleine K. Albright, wrote a letter to an appeals court saying that the immigration order endangers troops and undermines security.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/06/us/politics/trump-travel-ban-john-kerry.html', 'snippet': 'Prominent Democrats, including John Kerry and Madeleine K. Albright, wrote a letter to an appeals court saying that the immigration order endangers troops and undermines security.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A group of prominent Democrats who served in recent administrations, including John Kerry and Madeleine K. Albright, have called on the courts to extend a ruling blocking crucial parts of President Trump’s travel ban, saying the White House executive order would “endanger U.S. troops” and disrupt antiterrorism efforts.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/07/world/07democrats-web1/07democrats-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/07/world/07democrats-web1/07democrats-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/07/world/07democrats-web1/07democrats-web1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/07/world/07democrats-web1/07democrats-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/07/world/07democrats-web1/07democrats-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 60