gs.nytimes.com/2017/02/06/quick-and-statistically-useful-validation-of-page-performance-tweaks/', 'snippet': 'We wanted to share how we measure modest performance changes when a page has many assets of variable speed and complexity that can impact its performance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Improving page performance has been shown to be an important way to keep reader’s attention and improve advertising revenue. Pages on our desktop site can be complex and we’re always looking for ways to improve our performance. Since 2014, when our desktop site was last rebuilt, there have been big changes in client-side frameworks with great improvements to performance. Some of those site improvements will take us some time. We wondered if in the shorter term there are some smaller changes we could implement to make www.nytimes.com more performant.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quick and Statistically Useful Validation of Page Performance Tweaks', 'kicker': 'Open', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Software', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-06T13:01:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Justin Heideman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Justin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Heideman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/72a39285-156a-5f3c-800c-fefbd0231640', 'word_count': 1065, 'uri': 'nyt://article/72a39285-156a-5f3c-800c-fefbd0231640'}, {'abstract': 'The concerts will start in Vancouver, British Columbia, on Aug. 1, and will stop in New York, Rio de Janeiro and Berlin.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/06/arts/music/lady-gaga-joanne-tour.html', 'snippet': 'The concerts will start in Vancouver, British Columbia, on Aug. 1, and will stop in New York, Rio de Janeiro and Berlin.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hot on the heels of her inclusive, upbeat and largely apolitical Super Bowl halftime show, Lady Gaga announced a major world tour on Sunday night.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lady Gaga Announces ‘Joanne’ World Tour', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lady Gaga Announces World Tour on Twitter', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pop and Rock Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lady Gaga', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Joanne (Album)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-06T13:17:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher D. Shea', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/99660511-76db-5465-9e02-71b5ec44dad8', 'word_count': 167, 'uri': 'nyt://article/99660511-76db-5465-9e02-71b5ec44dad8'}, {'abstract': 'The entertainer’s long friendship with Donatella Versace added an element of “family” to the crystal-covered costume choices.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/06/fashion/lady-gaga-versace-super-bowl.html', 'snippet': 'The entertainer’s long friendship with Donatella Versace added an element of “family” to the crystal-covered costume choices.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last year, Lady Gaga belted out the national anthem at Super Bowl 50 in a red Lurex pantsuit by Gucci, but this time around, for her starring performance at halftime on Sunday — beginning with her plunge off the roof of NRG Stadium in Houston like some kind of giant sci-fi angel, dazzling the audience with both her Swarovski-covered shine and her performance — she turned to her old friend Donatella Versace.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/07/world/06OTR/06OTR-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/07/world/06OTR/06OTR-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/07/world/06OTR/06OTR-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/07/world/06OTR/06OTR-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/07/world/06OTR/06OTR-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/07/world/06OTR/06OTR-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/07/world/06OTR/06OTR-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Lady Gaga, in Versace, Sends a Sparkly Super Bowl Message', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value':