lead_paragraph': 'Small gold and silver food symbols like pineapples, chiles, pigs, eggs, basil and corn decorate leather bracelets and small pendants in this new line of culinary jewelry. Nicolle Nelson, the designer and founder of Delicacies, even offers some of the items set with tiny diamonds. With each totem, the symbolism of the food is explained, like health for ginger. A portion of the sale price goes to a charity that feeds the hungry: Delicacies, $50 to $4,000, delicaciesjewelry.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/08/dining/08burner-jewelry/08burner-jewelry-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/08/dining/08burner-jewelry/08burner-jewelry-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/08/dining/08burner-jewelry/08burner-jewelry-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/08/dining/08burner-jewelry/08burner-jewelry-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/08/dining/08burner-jewelry/08burner-jewelry-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/08/dining/08burner-jewelry/08burner-jewelry-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'ima