khouse.html', 'snippet': 'Hugue Dufour, the chef and owner of this Queens restaurant, will lead a three-hour course in cassoulet, duck confit techniques included.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Call it a crash course in cassoulet. Spend three hours with Hugue Dufour, the chef and an owner of M. Wells Steakhouse, and learn the details of this classic from southwestern France, from its history to the correct beans and various meats and techniques involved. The class includes demonstrations and hands-on work, and culminates in a cassoulet feast. Another class taught by Mr. Dufour, a Quebec native, is all about cooking with maple, both syrup and sugar: Cassoulet, Feb. 19 and March 19; Maple, Feb. 26 and March 26; all 3 to 6 p.m., $150; more classes to follow in April; M. Wells Steakhouse, 43-15 Crescent Street (43rd Avenue), Long Island City, Queens, 718-786-9060, magasinwells.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/08/dining/08BURNER-CLASS/08BURNER-CLASS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/08/dining/08BURNER-CLASS/08BURNER-CLASS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/08/dining/08BURNER-CLASS/08BURNER-CLASS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/08/dining/08BURNER-CLASS/08BURNER-CLASS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/08/dining/08BURNER-CLASS/08B