gic about Mr. Mizrahi’s Café Carlyle show, in which he talks about drugs, neuroses and genitalia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/06/arts/music/isaac-mizrahi-cabaret-interview.html', 'snippet': 'There is absolutely nothing misty-eyed or nostalgic about Mr. Mizrahi’s Café Carlyle show, in which he talks about drugs, neuroses and genitalia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Remedies for toenail fungus, the scary possible side effects of antidepressants, the beauty of male genitalia and the popularity of vodka tampons: These were among the topics addressed by Isaac Mizrahi during his raucously funny opening-night show last week at Café Carlyle, where he is appearing with a pop-jazz band through Saturday.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/07/arts/07MIZRAHI/07MIZRAHI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/07/arts/07MIZRAHI/07MIZRAHI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/07/arts/07MIZRAHI/07MIZRAHI-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/07/arts/07MIZRAHI/07MIZRAHI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/07/arts/07MIZRAHI/07MIZRAHI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/07/arts/07MIZRAHI/07MIZRAHI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo'