 the new administration, is the most sought-after read on Wall Street.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/06/business/dealbook/sorkin-seth-klarman-trump-investors.html', 'snippet': 'Seth Klarman is not a household name, but his letter to investors, warning about the new administration, is the most sought-after read on Wall Street.', 'lead_paragraph': 'He is the most successful and influential investor you have probably never heard of. His writings are so coveted and followed by Wall Street that a used copy of a book he wrote several decades ago about investing starts at $795 on Amazon, and a new copy sells for as much as $3,500.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/07/business/07DB-SORKINJP/07DB-SORKINJP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/07/business/07DB-SORKINJP/07DB-SORKINJP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/07/business/07DB-SORKINJP/07DB-SORKINJP-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/07/business/07DB-SORKINJP/07DB-SORKINJP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/07/business/07DB-SORKINJP/07DB-SORKINJP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/07/business/07DB-SORKINJP/07DB-SORKINJP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name':