e Badgers, with whom he won an N.C.A.A. title, Eaves, 60, is starting over at the bottom with a small Minnesota college where one of his sons is an assistant.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/08/sports/hockey/mike-eaves-coach-st-olaf-division-iii-wisconsin.html', 'snippet': 'Fired after 14 seasons of leading the Badgers, with whom he won an N.C.A.A. title, Eaves, 60, is starting over at the bottom with a small Minnesota college where one of his sons is an assistant.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NORTHFIELD, Minn. — The days begin and end the same. First thing in the morning, Mike Eaves pours himself a cup of coffee and looks out the picture window of his cabin overlooking Circle Lake and the large island it surrounds. At night, Eaves puts aside his cellphone and enjoys a glass of merlot with his wife, Beth, a tradition they call “wine at 9,” with the gas fireplace flickering and a starry lake view in the background.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/09/sports/09EAVES1/09EAVES1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/09/sports/09EAVES1/09EAVES1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/09/sports/09EAVES1/09EAVES1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/09/sports/09EAVES1/09EAVES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/09/sports/09EAVES1/09EAVES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 