emed to insinuate that Anthony lacked the necessary will to win.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/09/sports/carmelo-anthony-phil-jackson-new-york-knicks.html', 'snippet': 'Anthony said he had not read deeply into a missive fired off by Jackson, the Knicks’ president, that seemed to insinuate that Anthony lacked the necessary will to win.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Carmelo Anthony knew the question was coming Wednesday night, and when it did, his lips slowly creased into a smile. Had he seen the latest salvo from Phil Jackson — a Twitter post on Tuesday that endorsed an article asserting that Anthony did not have sufficient will to win and that, like a spot on a leopard, he could not be changed?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/10/sports/10carmelo/10carmelo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/10/sports/10carmelo/10carmelo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/10/sports/10carmelo/10carmelo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/10/sports/10carmelo/10carmelo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/10/sports/10carmelo/10carmelo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/10/sports/10carmelo/10carmelo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, '