, the pursuit of the technique continues.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/09/nyregion/arrest-in-joggers-murder-doesnt-alter-push-for-family-dna-searches.html', 'snippet': 'Advocates in New York pushed for the use of an ethically questionable familial DNA search to solve the high-profile murder of a jogger. Even though a suspect has now been charged in that case, the pursuit of the technique continues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When law enforcement officials began a push to use an ethically complicated forensic technique involving DNA in New York, they based their appeal on a high-profile case that had gone unsolved for months: the murder of Karina Vetrano, a 30-year-old jogger, in Queens last summer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/10/nyregion/10DNA1/10DNA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/10/nyregion/10DNA1/10DNA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/10/nyregion/10DNA1/10DNA1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/10/nyregion/10DNA1/10DNA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/10/nyregion/10DNA1/10DNA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/10/nyregion/10DNA1/10DNA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'super