, 'uri': 'nyt://article/808f2a9e-d29e-5dbd-aa7d-e280441daca2'}, {'abstract': 'The Belgian designer, who debuts at Calvin Klein on Friday, has had a long (and memorable) run in fashion. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/09/t-magazine/fashion/raf-simons-calvin-klein-debut-expect.html', 'snippet': 'The Belgian designer, who debuts at Calvin Klein on Friday, has had a long (and memorable) run in fashion. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'The excitement over Calvin Klein’s show during New York Fashion Week on Friday has been building for, well, months. That’s because Raf Simons — the newly installed chief creative officer of Calvin Klein — skipped last season to focus on rebuilding and rebranding the multibillion dollar American megalith for a brave new era. For Simons, the Calvin debut will be the latest of a series of memorable moments in his 22-year career. Here, 10 highlights from fashion’s favorite Belgian wunderkind and — potentially — clues as to what he’ll do at Calvin Klein.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/09/t-magazine/09tmag-raf-simons-slide-ZFIR/09tmag-raf-simons-slide-ZFIR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/09/t-magazine/09tmag-raf-simons-slide-ZFIR/09tmag-raf-simons-slide-ZFIR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/09/t-magazine/09tmag-raf-simons-slide-ZFIR/09tmag-raf-simons-slide-ZFIR-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/09/t-magazine/09tmag-raf-simons-slide-ZFIR/09tmag-raf-simons-slide-ZFIR-articleLarge.jpg', 'he