T20:54:43+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Real Estate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/12d51080-abb2-5f51-acb9-71fa2928a466', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/12d51080-abb2-5f51-acb9-71fa2928a466'}, {'abstract': 'A quiet area that has long attracted recent college graduates is seeing a surge of new construction.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/10/realestate/new-high-end-rentals-and-condos-coming-to-murray-hill.html', 'snippet': 'A quiet area that has long attracted recent college graduates is seeing a surge of new construction.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Murray Hill, long known as a go-to rental area for postgraduates, is going through some growing pains. With several new rental and condominium buildings popping up, along with continuing restoration work at the Queens-Midtown Tunnel, the once-peaceful eastern Midtown enclave is quiet no more.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New High-End Rentals and Condos Coming to Murray Hill', 'kicker': 'The High End', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Picking Up the Pace in Murray Hill', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Renting and Leasing (Real Estate)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Murray Hill (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-10T20:54:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kaya Laterman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kaya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Laterman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '