 the Google search results?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/11/your-money/haggler-trying-to-minimize-the-misery-of-mug-shots.html', 'snippet': 'For someone arrested on a D.U.I. charge nearly 30 years ago, why does it have to be so high in the Google search results?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Haggler has a spotless criminal record. Of course, that is because the Haggler is a fictional construct, which means he has no wrists, and this makes him impossible to handcuff. Here we have a key difference between the Haggler and the bumbling nitwit whose name is affixed to this column. He has wrists. Has he ever been arrested? Nobody cares. And the Haggler doesn’t know because he and the nitwit are barely on speaking terms.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/12/business/12Haggler/12Haggler-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/12/business/12Haggler/12Haggler-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/12/business/12Haggler/12Haggler-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/12/business/12Haggler/12Haggler-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 580, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/12/business/12Haggler/12Haggler-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 580}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/12/business/12Haggler/12Haggler-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 990, 'width