s included Teyana Taylor, the floor-thumping star of Kanye West’s “Fade” music video. “Who doesn’t love Fendi? It’s always the greatest,” she said. “I have Wang tomorrow and then I finish my album.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Calvin Klein, Fendi and W Magazine Hold Parties for Fashion Week', 'kicker': 'Party Coverage: Scene City', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magazines', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Calvin Klein Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'W (Magazine)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Street Seaport (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-11T20:15:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a910e1e4-82d1-5519-bb90-3c22544f6b94', 'word_count': 64, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a910e1e4-82d1-5519-bb90-3c22544f6b94'}, {'abstract': 'The “fiduciary rule” is solid, and those behind efforts to roll it back will have a difficult time asserting otherwise.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/11/opinion/retirement-advice-in-the-trump-era.html', 'snippet': 'The “fiduciary rule” is solid, and those behind efforts to roll it back will have a difficult time asserting otherwise.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A federal judge in Texas did President Trump a favor last week. It came in a decision in a case filed by the financial industry against the Labor Department to overturn an Obama-era regulation called the “fiduciary rule,” which requires financial advisers to put their clients’ interests first whe