67f'}, {'abstract': 'Want a break from politics? Here’s a collection from The New York Times and other outlets: stories of ticket scalpers, subway romances and ice fishers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/14/nytnow/13-great-stories-that-have-nothing-to-do-with-politics.html', 'snippet': 'Want a break from politics? Here’s a collection from The New York Times and other outlets: stories of ticket scalpers, subway romances and ice fishers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Welcome to Our Picks, a guide to the best stuff to read, watch and listen to from around the internet. We know you don’t want to read only political news, so we’re collecting great long-form articles, podcasts, videos and other web treasures you might like when you need a break. And yes, we’re also tooting our own horn here. We’ll share can’t-miss Times stories from the week and surface some gems you might have overlooked.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/14/briefing/14Picks-slide-UATJ/14Picks-slide-UATJ-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/14/briefing/14Picks-slide-UATJ/14Picks-slide-UATJ-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/14/briefing/14Picks-slide-UATJ/14Picks-slide-UATJ-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/14/briefing/14Picks-slide-UATJ/14Picks-slide-UATJ-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/14/briefing/14Picks-slide-UATJ/14Picks-slide-UATJ-articleLarge.jpg'