Is that about to end?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Title IX is perhaps best known for demanding that male and female student athletes be treated equally, but the federal statute, passed in 1972, also offers protections for pregnant or parenting students, transgender students and students who have been victims of sexual or gender-based harassment or violence on their campuses. Many advocates are concerned, however, about the future of those protections under President Trump.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/11/opinion/10lutherWeb/10lutherWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/11/opinion/10lutherWeb/10lutherWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/11/opinion/10lutherWeb/10lutherWeb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/11/opinion/10lutherWeb/10lutherWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/11/opinion/10lutherWeb/10lutherWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/11/opinion/10lutherWeb/10lutherWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/11/opinion/10lutherWeb/10lutherWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop