l party at a TriBeCa loft, where models like Hilary Rhoda posed in front of photographs of themselves. “It’s very, very cool,” Mr. Rhoda said about the format. “It’s an amazing way of showing the collection and I think people are really liking it.” See more from the night’s parties above.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Zac Posen, Moncler and Baja East Partied on Tuesday Night of Fashion Week', 'kicker': 'Party Coverage: Scene City', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Moncler (Fashion Label)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Posen, Zac', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-15T22:28:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Taylor Harris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Taylor', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Harris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fc314a2c-3adc-521a-b409-388626f47b77', 'word_count': 71, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fc314a2c-3adc-521a-b409-388626f47b77'}, {'abstract': 'The focus on the coming mayor’s race overlooks the back-room deal-making over another powerhouse position in city government, the City Council speakership.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/15/nyregion/new-york-city-speaker.html', 'snippet': 'The focus on the coming mayor’s race overlooks the back-room deal-making over another powerhouse position in city government, the City Council speakership.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With all the political focus in New York City trained on the 2017 mayoral race, there is another important battle being quietly waged