nster.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/16/t-magazine/fashion/gentle-monster-glasses-tilda-swinton.html', 'snippet': 'In a marriage of devastating cool, the actress collaborates with Gentle Monster.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The latest runway shows featured sunglasses with colored lenses and vintage-looking frames. Ever on point, Tilda Swinton has now collaborated with the ultracool Korean eyewear brand Gentle Monster (whose designers she met in Seoul while shooting a movie with the director Bong Joon-ho) on some retro shades of her own. Swinton says the appeal is their “warrior-shield” aspect — providing fierceness “even for the chronically shy.” The lenses, which come in a pale blue and a rosy red, among other colors, also just look really good.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '110', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/16/t-magazine/glasses/glasses-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/16/t-magazine/glasses/glasses-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/16/t-magazine/glasses/glasses-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/16/t-magazine/glasses/glasses-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 295, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/16/t-magazine/glasses/glasses-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 295}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/16/t-magazine/glasses/glasses-jumbo.jpg', '