 like the opposite of fear and rumor: a call to boycott. In the New York region and around the country, many cooks, carpenters, plumbers and grocery store owners decided to answer it and not work on Thursday as part of a national “day without immigrants” in protest of the Trump administration’s policies toward them.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On a ‘Day Without Immigrants,’ Workers Show Their Presence by Staying Home', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Immigrants Stay Home, and Their Absence Reverberates', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-16T15:53:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liz Robbins and Annie Correal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liz', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Robbins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Annie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Correal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2ed1915f-7c4f-5f06-b77c-2bbc5038a7e3', 'word_count': 1214, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2ed1915f-7c4f-5f06-b77c-2bbc5038a7e3'}, {'abstract': 'Americans had previously won only two silvers and a bronze at the world championships.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/16/sports/skiing/lowell-bailey-wins-uss-first-biathlon-world-title