 unveiled a new beauty line with Ms. Crawford’s 15-year-old daughter, and VFiles took over the downtown club S.O.B.’s', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/16/fashion/new-york-fashion-week-kaia-gerber-cindy-crawford-vfiles-crew-marc-jacobs.html', 'snippet': 'Marc Jacobs unveiled a new beauty line with Ms. Crawford’s 15-year-old daughter, and VFiles took over the downtown club S.O.B.’s', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Wednesday night, Kaia Gerber, 15, the daughter of Cindy Crawford and Rande Gerber, hosted a party in the West Village to unveil a new makeup line by Marc Jacobs. “She’s the one that told me that less is more,” said Ms. Gerber, recounting her mom’s beauty tips. Ms. Gerber has more than 1.1 million Instagram followers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kaia Gerber, Cindy Crawford and the VFiles Crew Partied on Wednesday Night of Fashion Week', 'kicker': 'Party Coverage: Scene City', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Marc Jacobs International LLC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crawford, Cindy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gerber, Kaia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'VFiles', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-16T20:05:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joanna Nikas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nikas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee04e9