that established a standard for its breadth, accuracy and readability.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/17/arts/music/irwin-stambler-dead-creator-of-rock-encyclopedia.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Stambler wrote “The Encyclopedia of Pop, Rock and Soul,” a tome that established a standard for its breadth, accuracy and readability.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Irwin Stambler, who was trained as an aeronautics engineer but whose deep love for music inspired him to write “The Encyclopedia of Pop, Rock and Soul” — a major feat of research before the internet made it easier to find out more about Bo Diddley or the Beach Boys — died on Feb. 10 in Los Angeles. He was 92.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/18/arts/18stambler-obit-1/17stambler-obit-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 604, 'width': 477, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/18/arts/18stambler-obit-1/17stambler-obit-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 604, 'width': 477, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/18/arts/18stambler-obit-1/17stambler-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/18/arts/18stambler-obit-1/17stambler-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Irwin Stambler, 92, Dies; Reference Book Writer With Songs in His Heart', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Irwin Stambler, 92, a Writer With Music in His Heart', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stambler, Irwin (1924-2017