 time to figure out whether she wanted to marry Demetrios Orfanoudis before their wedding on Jan. 21. First came five years of long-distance dating. Then, just before the wedding itself, came an unexpected stretch of time with nothing to do but sit and think.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'They Waited 5 Years (and 45 Minutes) to Marry', 'kicker': 'Vows', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Waiting 5 Years (and 45 Minutes) to Marry', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Greek-Americans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dating and Relationships', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-17T15:33:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tammy La Gorce', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tammy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'La Gorce', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/68a42018-4df3-544f-8eee-c4c37e22e015', 'word_count': 1723, 'uri': 'nyt://article/68a42018-4df3-544f-8eee-c4c37e22e015'}, {'abstract': 'Vittorio Grigolo, the tenor in this Massenet work, moves energetically through his instrument, and he was matched, effusion for effusion, in the orchestra pit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/17/arts/music/werther-met-opera-review.html', 'snippet': 'Vittorio Grigolo, the tenor in this Massenet work, moves energetically through his instrument, and he was matched, effusion for effusion, in the orchestra pit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I do not often blush while sitting in the darkness of an opera house. But when Massenet