y, the president himself could stop by your table for a quick chat. But you will have to pay $200,000 for the privilege — and the few available spots are going fast.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/18/us/18MARALAGO-01/18MARALAGO-01-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/18/us/18MARALAGO-01/18MARALAGO-01-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/18/us/18MARALAGO-01/18MARALAGO-01-thumbLarge-v4.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/18/us/18MARALAGO-01/18MARALAGO-01-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/18/us/18MARALAGO-01/18MARALAGO-01-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/18/us/18MARALAGO-01/18MARALAGO-01-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/18/us/18MARALAGO-01/18MARALAGO-01-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1376, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Trump’s ‘Winter White House’: A Peek at the Exclusive Members’ List at Mar-a-Lago', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For $200,000, a Chance  to Whisper in Trump’s Ear', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mar-a-Lago (Palm Beach, Fla)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Palm Beach (Fla)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Conflicts of Interest', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-18T10:30:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Confessore, Maggie Haberman and Eric Lipton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Confessore', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Maggie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Haberman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lipton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b807bc3d-0955-58d0-a7f1-53668b2a003b', 'word_count': 2024, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b807bc3d-0955-58d0-a7f1-53668b2a003b'}, {'abstract': 'As lawmakers head home, their constituents will be waiting for them, at events like those in South Carolina and New York, and some may not be happy to see them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/18/us/politics/town-hall-protests-obamacare.html', 'snippet': 'As lawmakers head home, their constituents will be waiting for them, at events like those in South Carolina and New York, and some may not be happy to see them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOUNT PLEASANT, S.C. — The Republican lawmakers stood with fixed smiles, shifting in place, facing down turmoil but no trial inside a municipal courtroom overstuffed with constituents.',