 'word_count': 261, 'uri': 'nyt://article/33830be1-814e-5fd4-bc43-49cae6d50bc4'}, {'abstract': 'Bruce Haight panics. Or maybe it’s all part of his plan to fool us.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/18/crosswords/uh-oh.html', 'snippet': 'Bruce Haight panics. Or maybe it’s all part of his plan to fool us.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SUNDAY PUZZLE — There are people who will say that puns are the lowest form of humor, and I generally don’t bother arguing with them. I am someone who appreciates a good pun. I don’t know what that says about me, but at a time when we could collectively use a sense of humor, I will take my guffaws where I can get them. That is yet another reason I turn to crossword puzzles, other than the fact that it’s my job to solve them and write about them.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/19/crosswords/19wordplay-hula/19wordplay-hula-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/19/crosswords/19wordplay-hula/19wordplay-hula-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/19/crosswords/19wordplay-hula/19wordplay-hula-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/19/crosswords/19wordplay-hula/19wordplay-hula-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 1806, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/19/crosswords/19wordplay-hula/19wordplay-hula-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbSt