 'lead_paragraph': 'MELBOURNE, Fla. — Never let it be said that President Trump waits until the last minute. With just 1,354 days until the next presidential election, Mr. Trump kicked off his re-election campaign here on Saturday with a boisterous, sign-waving, slogan-chanting, patriotic-song-singing rally that lacked only an opponent for him to run against.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Trump Returns to Campaign Trail After a Month in Office', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trump Returns to Campaign After a Month in Office', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2020', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-19T01:40:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Baker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c0528739-435b-536f-8cd0-292c326382a2', 'word_count': 989, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c0528739-435b-536f-8cd0-292c326382a2'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the day for Sunday, February 19, 2017.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/18/todayspaper/quotation-of-the-day.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the day for Sunday, February 19, 2017.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Most presidents feel very strongly about the dignity of the office they hold. Mr. Trump has busted every norm in campaigning, and he seems to be doing the same with the traditio