aunch from Kennedy Space Center in more than five years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/19/science/spacex-launch-kennedy-space-center.html', 'snippet': 'The rocket lifted off from a launchpad used for the Apollo moon missions. It was the first launch from Kennedy Space Center in more than five years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KENNEDY SPACE CENTER, Fla. — Engines ignited and a rocket lifted off here on Sunday, for the first time since the last space shuttle launch five and a half years ago.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'SpaceX Launches Rocket Carrying Space Station Cargo', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'SpaceX Launches Rocket Carrying Space Station Cargo', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Space Exploration Technologies Corp', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Private Spaceflight', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kennedy Space Center', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Space and Astronomy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Musk, Elon', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-19T14:53:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kenneth Chang', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kenneth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chang', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2f6069aa-6cfc-5771-bac2-4117e1b5a7f1', 'word_count': 1212, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2f6069aa-6cfc-5771-bac2-4117e1b5a7f1'}, {'abstract': 'Fashion East’s newcomers and Halpern join J.W. Anderson, Simone Rocha and Versus Versace on the runways.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/19/fashion/london-fashion-week-j-w-anderson-simone-rocha.html'