e Wines & Spirits, 35 Greenwich Avenue (Charles Street), 212-255-0222, terrysnyc.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/22/dining/22BURNER-CIDER/22BURNER-CIDER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 889, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/22/dining/22BURNER-CIDER/22BURNER-CIDER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 889}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/22/dining/22BURNER-CIDER/22BURNER-CIDER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 691, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/22/dining/22BURNER-CIDER/22BURNER-CIDER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1382, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/22/dining/22BURNER-CIDER/22BURNER-CIDER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/22/dining/22BURNER-CIDER/22BURNER-CIDER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/22/dining/22BURNER-CIDER/22BURNER-CIDER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '3 Swedish Hard Ciders to Pair With a Winter Meal', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Sip: 3 Swedish Hard Ciders to Pair With Winter Food', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject'