The inmate, Thomas D. Arthur, had challenged the use of a chemical in the state’s lethal injection protocol, saying it could cause excruciating pain.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/21/us/politics/supreme-court-sotomayor-thomas-arthur-death-row-appeal.html', 'snippet': 'The inmate, Thomas D. Arthur, had challenged the use of a chemical in the state’s lethal injection protocol, saying it could cause excruciating pain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Supreme Court turned down an appeal on Tuesday from an Alabama death row inmate who said the state intended to kill him using chemicals that could cause excruciating pain. As is the court’s custom, the justices in the majority gave no reasons for declining to hear the case.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/22/us/22lethal1/22lethal1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/22/us/22lethal1/22lethal1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/22/us/22lethal1/22lethal1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/22/us/22lethal1/22lethal1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/22/us/22lethal1/22lethal1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/22/us/22lethal1/22lethal1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'th