g', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/21/t-magazine/fashion/21tmag-48hours-kane-slide-DDW5/21tmag-48hours-kane-slide-DDW5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/21/t-magazine/fashion/21tmag-48hours-kane-slide-DDW5/21tmag-48hours-kane-slide-DDW5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In the Studio With Christopher Kane', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2017-02-21T22:52:21+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'T Magazine', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Fashion & Beauty', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/83f3c8a8-5fdb-593c-9658-7686000306e0', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/83f3c8a8-5fdb-593c-9658-7686000306e0'}, {'abstract': 'Before his London Fashion Week show, Christopher Kane and his sister Tammy do last-minute fittings along with a Boston terrier named Bruce Tito.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/21/t-magazine/fashion/christopher-kane-48-hours-london-fashion-week.html', 'snippet': 'Before his London Fashion Week show, Christopher Kane and his sister Tammy do last-minute fittings along with a Boston terrier named Bruce Tito.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Christopher Kane, the Glasgow-born designer whose collections have been an undisputed London Fashion Week highlight for just over a decade, is fitting a model in a bubblegum-pink damask dress. The fabric is a little bit bridesmaid-y, the type of thing you might expect of another designer who’s been in the business longer, and dresses a woman just a little bit older. It could also be upholstering a chair in a royal residence. But then Kane, 34, puts a pair of foam-rubber Croc clogs on the model’s feet. They are lined with mink —but the affect is still jarring. “These caused outrage,” he says in his strong Scottish accent, referring to the bejewelled Crocs he showed in his spring/summer 2017 collection, which he has updated for fall. He recalls a few of the unprintable comments left on his Instagram account. Then he laughs. “I feel like Kim Kardashian!”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '48 Hours With London’s Favorite Off-Beat Designer', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'London Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kane, Christopher (1982- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-21T22:52:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Fashion & Beauty', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexander Fury', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexander', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fury', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9ba3486d-b7e3-56d6-8c0b-c31681e7c762', 'word_count': 882, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9ba3486d-b7e3-56d6-8c0b-c31681e7c762'}, {'abstract': 'Yiannopoulos’s true cause is himself. Sound familiar?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/21/opinion/milo-is-the-mini-donald.html', 'snippet': 'Yiannopoulos’s true cause is himself. Sound familiar?', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you halved Donald Trump’s age, changed his sexual orientation, gave him a Br