-americans-skiing-withdraw-safety.html', 'snippet': 'The two and another American, Laurenne Ross, pulled out of a World Cup race in Switzerland because of snow that was described as too soft to be safe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The world’s best skiers zipped down the slopes in the Swiss Alps on Friday. But the top Americans, Lindsey Vonn and Mikaela Shiffrin, were not among them. Vonn, Shiffrin and another American, Laurenne Ross, pulled out of the World Cup event because they felt the course conditions were not safe.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/25/sports/25SKIING/25SKIING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/25/sports/25SKIING/25SKIING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/25/sports/25SKIING/25SKIING-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/25/sports/25SKIING/25SKIING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 899, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/25/sports/25SKIING/25SKIING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 899}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/25/sports/25SKIING/25SKIING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 684, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/25/sports/25SKIING/25SKIING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1986, 'width': 1325, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Lindsey Vonn and Mikaela Shiffrin Withdraw From Ski Race Over Safety', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Vonn and Shiffrin Withdraw From Ski Race Over Safety', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World Cup (Skiing)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shiffrin, Mikaela', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vonn, Lindsey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-24T13:51:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Skiing', 'byline': {'original': 'By Victor Mather', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Victor', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mather', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7d88f5a4-b864-50a1-bd98-d3e046ee17bb', 'word_count': 534, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7d88f5a4-b864-50a1-bd98-d3e046ee17bb'}, {'abstract': 'When he isn’t performing in “Jitney,” Mr. Holland catches up with friends, family and scripts in need of a read. Then he usually falls asleep in his favorite place.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/24/nyregion/how-andre-holland-spends-the-day-onstage-and-on-his-couch.html', 'snippet': 'When he isn’t performing in “Jitney,” Mr. Holland catches up with friends, family and scripts in need of a read. Then he usually falls asleep in his favorite place.', 'lead_paragraph': 'André Holland can currently be seen acting in three highly praised projects: the Oscar-nominated film “Moonlight”; the Broadway debut of August Wilson’s play “Jitney,” which had its premiere in 1982; and the Cinemax series “The Knick.” So it goes without saying that what he really wants to do is produce. Mr. Holland, 37, who grew up in Alabama, recently optioned “All God’s Dangers: The Life of Nate Shaw,” which won a National Book Award in 1975, and Onaje X. O. Woodbine’s “Black Gods of the Asphalt: Religion, Hip-Hop and Street Basketball.” He recently moved from SoHo to Fort Greene, Brooklyn.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/26/nyregion/26ROUTINE1/26ROUTINE1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/26/nyregion/26ROUTINE1/26ROUTINE1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/26/nyregion/26ROUTINE1/26ROUTINE1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/26/nyregion/26ROUTINE1/26ROUTINE1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/26/nyregion/26ROUTINE1/26ROUTINE1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/26/nyregion/26ROUTINE1/26ROUTINE1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/26/nyregion/26ROUTINE1/26ROUTINE1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How André Holland Spends the Day: Onstage, and on His Couch', 'kicker': 'Sunday Routine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Acting on