above all, the need to “sweep away the garbage” of a corrupt political establishment.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/19/world/00mareshki1/00mareshki1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/19/world/00mareshki1/00mareshki1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/19/world/00mareshki1/00mareshki1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/19/world/00mareshki1/00mareshki1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/19/world/00mareshki1/00mareshki1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/19/world/00mareshki1/00mareshki1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/19/world/00mareshki1/00mareshki1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Bulgaria, a Businessman Who Talks (and Acts) Like Trump', 'kicker': 'The Saturday Profile', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Bulgaria, a Tycoon Who Talks (and Acts) Like Trump', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bulgaria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mareshki, Veselin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-24T14:00:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Lyman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lyman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Biography', '_id': 'nyt://article/9711cab0-d534-527d-a86b-f63ab5c201b6', 'word_count': 1290, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9711cab0-d534-527d-a86b-f63ab5c201b6'}, {'abstract': 'Political outsiders have felt the wind at their backs since the election of President Trump, and many embrace their resemblance to him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/24/world/europe/zbigniew-stonoga-andrej-babis.html', 'snippet': 'Political outsiders have felt the wind at their backs since the election of President Trump, and many embrace their resemblance to him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WARSAW — Political outsiders across Central Europe, preaching a populist message and promising to overturn the establishment, have felt the wind at their backs since the election of the new American president. We recently profiled one of them, Veselin Mareshki of Bulgaria, who says he sees himself as “an anti-establishment candidate like Donald Trump.” Many others embrace the connection, too, whether it is their backgrounds in business, their bombastic personalities, or their canny use of celebrity and social media.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/25/world/europe/25trumps-babis/25trumps-babis-thumbSt