 to the Cavaliers on Thursday, and he is likely to miss the Knicks’ game on Saturday. After that, his return is unclear.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/24/sports/basketball/kristaps-porzingis-new-york-knicks.html', 'snippet': 'Porzingis sustained the injury during a loss to the Cavaliers on Thursday, and he is likely to miss the Knicks’ game on Saturday. After that, his return is unclear.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GREENBURGH, N.Y. — Hobbled as he was, Kristaps Porzingis took the floor Friday during the Knicks’ practice. He joined in with his teammates in a free-throw competition at the end of the session, exchanging shots with Courtney Lee at one basket. Part of Porzingis’s attire: ankle-high socks and flip-flops.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/25/sports/25knicks/25knicks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/25/sports/25knicks/25knicks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/25/sports/25knicks/25knicks-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/25/sports/25knicks/25knicks-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/25/sports/25knicks/25knicks-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/25/sports/25knicks/25knicks-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo'