orted.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/25/world/europe/germany-bnd-surveillance-der-spiegel.html', 'snippet': 'Documents indicate that Germany spied on the phones, faxes or emails of several foreign news organizations, Der Spiegel reported.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — Germany’s foreign intelligence service apparently spied on the phones, faxes or emails of several foreign news organizations, including The New York Times, the British Broadcasting Corporation and Reuters, the German newsmagazine Der Spiegel reported on Saturday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Germany’s Intelligence Service Spied on Journalists, Report Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Report Says Germany Monitored Journalists', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens by Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Intelligence Service (Germany)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Der Spiegel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Merkel, Angela', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-25T19:57:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alison Smale', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alison', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smale', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cd5dfef5-e0da-56f1-972c-7de94f436b71', 'word_count': 522, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cd5dfef5-e0da-56f1-972c-7de94f436b71'}, {'abstract': '“I didn’t take two bullets over there for the government. I didn’t take them for no president.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/25/opinion/sunday/playing-poker-with-world-war-ii-and-vietnam.html', 'snippet': '“I didn’t take two bullets over there for the government. I didn’t take them for no president.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'NINE MILE FALLS, Wash. — I enjoy a poker room. The stakes for which I play are so low, often as not everyone at the table cashes out within $10 of his buy-in. The players tend to be older men, retired, on fixed incomes, widowers or divorced and nowhere near getting on that horse again. The dealers call them by name; the waiters deliver their drinks without the bother of an order.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/26/opinion/sunday/26holbert/26holbert-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/26/opinion/sunday/26holbert/26holbert-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/26/opinion/sunday/26holbert/26holbert-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/26/opinion/sunday/26holbert/26holbert-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 341, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/26/opinion/sunday/26holbert/26holbert-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 341}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/26/opinion/sunday/26holbert/26holbert-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 582, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'cro