though some complained that overcast weather dampened their views.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/26/science/ring-of-fire-eclipse-travels-across-south-america-and-africa.html', 'snippet': 'Skywatchers in South America and Africa tweeted their experiences on Sunday, though some complained that overcast weather dampened their views.', 'lead_paragraph': 'People in parts of South America and Africa were treated to a rare sight on Sunday: a “ring of fire” eclipse, when the moon moves in between the Earth and the sun, briefly replacing it with a blazing, fiery ring.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Ring of Fire’ Eclipse Travels Across South America and Africa', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ring of Fire: A Shadow Over South America and Africa', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Eclipses', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Moon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sun', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Space and Astronomy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Aeronautics and Space Administration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South America', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-26T22:37:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liam Stack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2bab9a88-8478-518b-921b-dfc7b73652c5', 'word_count': 296, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2bab9a88-8478-518b-921b-dfc7b73652c5'}, {'abstract': 'After Mr. Skrowaczewski defected in 1960 (Communist rule “was impossible for musicians and composers”), he led the Minnesota Orchestra for 19 years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/26/arts/music/stanislaw-skrowaczewski-conductor-who-fled-poland-dies-at-93.html', 'snippet': 'After Mr. Skrowaczewski defected in 1960 (Communist rule “was impossible for musicians and composers”), he led the Minnesota Orchestra for 19 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Stanislaw Skrowaczewski, a conductor who defected from his native Poland in 1960 to take charge of the Minnesota Orchestra for the next 19 years, died on Tuesday in Minneapolis. He was 93.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/27/arts/25skrowaczewski-obit/25skrowaczewski-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/27/arts/25skrowaczewski-obit/25skrowaczewski-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/27/arts/25skrowaczewski-obit/25skrowaczewski-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/27/arts/25skrowaczewski-obit/25skrowaczewski-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 978, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/27/arts/25skrowaczewski-obit/25skrowaczewski-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 978}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/27/arts/25skrowaczewski-obit/25skrowaczewski-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'widt