 500 With Last-Lap Pass', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Kurt Busch Wins Daytona, Finally, on Last-Lap Pass', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Racing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Daytona 500 (Auto Race)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Assn of Stock Car Auto Racing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Busch, Kurt (1978- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Jimmie', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Patrick, Danica', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Daytona Beach (Fla)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-27T01:21:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Kerasotis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kerasotis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d56f0681-bf96-52ec-a9a9-7c40a85c8b29', 'word_count': 794, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d56f0681-bf96-52ec-a9a9-7c40a85c8b29'}, {'abstract': 'The exchange said its union with Deutsche Börse was in jeopardy after European regulators demanded the sale of an additional asset.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/26/business/dealbook/london-stock-exchange-merger-deutsche-borse.html', 'snippet': 'The exchange said its union with Deutsche Börse was in jeopardy after European regulators demanded the sale of an additional asset.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The London Stock Exchange Group said late on Sunday that European regulators were unlikely to approve its merger with Deutsche Börse, which would have created a European heavyweight in a rapidly consolidating industry.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The Ne