cars-best-picture-moonlight-academy-awards.html', 'snippet': '“I’m holding the envelope and the award, and I had just given my speech, and there are people on the stage with headsets, and I thought, ‘That doesn’t seem right.’”', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — It’s one of Hollywood’s most secretive and unusual jobs: Brian Cullinan, a partner at the accounting firm PwC, and a colleague are tasked with making sure the statuettes at the annual Academy Awards are correctly distributed. He stands in the wings of the Dolby Theater here in a tuxedo and pulls sealed envelopes out of a briefcase, giving the correct one to presenters as they walk onto the stage.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/27/arts/27oscars-bestpicture/27oscars-bestpicture-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/27/arts/27oscars-bestpicture/27oscars-bestpicture-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/27/arts/27oscars-bestpicture/27oscars-bestpicture-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/27/arts/27oscars-bestpicture/27oscars-bestpicture-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/27/arts/27oscars-bestpicture/27oscars-bestpicture-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 427}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/27/arts/27oscars-bestpicture/27oscars-bestpicture-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 729, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/27/arts/27oscars-bestpicture/27oscars-bestpicture-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1458, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What It Was Like Onstage During the Oscars 2017 Best Picture Mistake', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'From ‘The Envelope, Please’  to ‘Whoops!’ on Oscars Show', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Academy Awards (Oscars)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'PricewaterhouseCoopers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'La La Land (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Moonlight (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jenkins, Barry', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Horowitz, Jordan', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-27T09:59:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooks Barnes and Cara Buckley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Cara', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buckley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/75c3f85c-11e6-57fb-97ca-36ce425187c8', 'word_count': 1386, 'uri': 'nyt://article/75c3f85c-11e6-57fb-97ca-36ce425187c8'}, {'abstract': 'From San Diego to Puerto Rico, some best