 'uri': 'nyt://article/71d08cfb-dedf-55b2-a90d-157a266b2d57'}, {'abstract': 'A Pennsylvania judge, responding to concerns about pretrial publicity, ruled Monday that a jury from another county will be brought in for the sexual assault trial.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/27/arts/television/bill-cosby-judge-decides-to-import-jury-for-trial.html', 'snippet': 'A Pennsylvania judge, responding to concerns about pretrial publicity, ruled Monday that a jury from another county will be brought in for the sexual assault trial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Responding to Bill Cosby’s concerns about the effect of pretrial publicity, a Pennsylvania judge ruled Monday that a jury from another county in the state will be brought in to hear the sexual assault trial against him. But the trial, now scheduled to start in June, will stay in Norristown, a suburb outside Philadelphia, the judge said.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/28/arts/28cosby-item/28cosby-item-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/28/arts/28cosby-item/28cosby-item-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/28/arts/28cosby-item/28cosby-item-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/28/arts/28cosby-item/28cosby-item-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/28/arts/28cosby-item/28cosby-item-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400