gy/personaltech/searching-for-a-new-travel-companion.html', 'snippet': 'The popular WorldMate service is retiring this year, but you can find similar apps and trip organizers to replace it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q. I have been tied to WorldMate, an iPhone app that tracks and centralizes travel reservations, for years. It’s great and I love it, but the app is being discontinued and I need a replacement. Any ideas?', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Searching for a New Travel Companion', 'kicker': 'Tech Tip', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Replacing an App for Travel Planning', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'WorldMate Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-27T17:45:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. D. Biersdorfer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/165c44eb-772c-5e91-94ea-ea39e5debd1d', 'word_count': 300, 'uri': 'nyt://article/165c44eb-772c-5e91-94ea-ea39e5debd1d'}, {'abstract': 'If current trends persist, women born in South Korea in 2030 will live perhaps 90 years on average, researchers said, the longest life span in the world.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/27/health/life-span-south-korea-women.html', 'snippet': 'If current trends persist, women born in South Korea in 2030 will live perhaps 90 years on average, researchers said, the longest life span in the world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Life spans in the world’s wealthi