een varieties from Mexico and Guatemala. Somewhat larger than the Hass, the Sharwil has a skin that will not turn black as it ripens. The fairly dense, buttery flesh has a distinctive flavor, at once nutty and herbal, and the pit is smaller: Sharwil avocados, $3.99 each, Agata & Valentina and Eataly all month.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/01/dining/01BURNER-AVOCADO/01BURNER-AVOCADO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/01/dining/01BURNER-AVOCADO/01BURNER-AVOCADO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/01/dining/01BURNER-AVOCADO/01BURNER-AVOCADO-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/01/dining/01BURNER-AVOCADO/01BURNER-AVOCADO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/01/dining/01BURNER-AVOCADO/01BURNER-AVOCADO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/01/dining/01BURNER-AVOCADO/01BURNER-AVOCADO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/01/dining/01BURNER-AVOCADO/01BURNER-AVOCADO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'mai