illed salmon or beef stew. All will be available for the month of March. Purim begins on the evening of March 11: Savory and sweet hamantaschen, $4 for two, $10 for six and $18 a dozen in stores (prices are different online), Breads Bakery, breadsbakery.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/01/dining/01BURNER-COOKIES/01BURNER-COOKIES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/01/dining/01BURNER-COOKIES/01BURNER-COOKIES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/01/dining/01BURNER-COOKIES/01BURNER-COOKIES-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/01/dining/01BURNER-COOKIES/01BURNER-COOKIES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/01/dining/01BURNER-COOKIES/01BURNER-COOKIES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/01/dining/01BURNER-COOKIES/01BURNER-COOKIES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/01/dining/01BURNER-COOKIES/01BURNER-COOKIES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Savory Purim Treats From Breads Bakery', 'kicker