s at community centers and day schools.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two attacks on Jewish cemeteries in the last week have resulted in an outpouring of more than $136,000 in donations from thousands of Muslims and others, who have also pledged to financially support Jewish institutions if there are further attacks.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Muslims Give Money to Jewish Institutions That Are Attacked', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As Jewish Institutions Endure Attacks, Muslims Pledge Financial Aid', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTI-SEMITISM', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vandalism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cemeteries', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-02-28T01:24:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel Victor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Victor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/831c5073-3b9f-5b77-915c-c68ce0d15b5b', 'word_count': 735, 'uri': 'nyt://article/831c5073-3b9f-5b77-915c-c68ce0d15b5b'}, {'abstract': 'Detroit, which has won four Stanley Cups while playing at Joe Louis Arena, is expected to end a long playoff streak in its final season there.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/02/27/sports/hockey/detroit-red-wings-joe-louis-arena-mike-ilitch.html', 'snippet': 'Detroit, which has won four Stanley Cups while playing at Joe Louis Arena, is expected to end a long playoff streak in its final season there.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DETROIT — Since opening in 1978, Detroit’s Joe Louis Arena has brought N.H.L.